This project is a set of mods, layouts and helper scripts for the Herdr app. It is not affiliated with
or endorsed by the Herdr project.

Portions of this project are modified copies of mods that ship with Herdr (Apache License 2.0).
Each of these files says so in its first line:

  mods/tabs-plus      from Herdr's `tabs` mod
  mods/files-plus     from Herdr's `files` mod
  mods/changes-plus   from Herdr's `changes` mod
  mods/agents-ctx     from Herdr's `agents` mod
  mods/space-folders  from Herdr's `spaces` mod

Other third-party work, with its own license text under licenses/:

  mods/space-folders  folder logic ported from jankeesvw/herdr-space-folders (MIT)
  mods/git-graph      see licenses/README.md (MIT / MIT-or-Apache)
